><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"1\" data-flow-node=\"model\" transform=\"translate(440 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">拟合周期产油代理</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">由可见输入计算</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"baseline\" transform=\"translate(440 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f4efe4\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">简单方法对照</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">相同数据独立计算</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-node=\"gate\" data-flow-step=\"2\"><polygon points=\"735,20 800,65 735,110 670,65\" fill=\"#fbf0d9\"/><text x=\"735\" y=\"71\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">结果是否满足检查？补充观测再重新计算</text></g>\n <g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"2\" data-flow-node=\"review\" transform=\"translate(670 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#f6eade\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">检查约束与来源</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">不读评价真值预测</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"output\" transform=\"translate(880 30)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"65\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#e4f0e7\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">图表与当前结果</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">保留参数和评价分母</text></g><g class=\"case-flow-node\" data-flow-step=\"3\" data-flow-node=\"compare\" transform=\"translate(880 140)\"><rect width=\"190\" height=\"55\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#eff3f5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-title\">独立评价对比</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"case-flow-detail\">误差或合法性可复算</text></g>\n </svg></div><figcaption>详细原理、数据图表与计算见下方各步骤。<span data-flow-instruction></span></figcaption></figure><figure><h3>对齐注汽焖井生产</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"输入与结果之间的有向流程\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f5f4\"/><g fill=\"#254755\" font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"27\" y=\"63\">对齐注汽焖井生产</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"32\" width=\"164\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b97e45\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polyline points=\"175,57 189,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"174\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"63\">拟合周期产油代理</text><polyline points=\"350,57 364,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"349\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"365\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"63\">约束蒸汽量搜索参数</text><polyline points=\"525,57 539,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"524\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"63\">核对收益与热量账</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"125\">当前步骤：对齐注汽焖井生产</text></g></svg><figcaption>时间边界一致的完整周期记录。焖井阶段没有生产量，不与生产阶段重叠。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>拟合周期产油代理</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"输入与结果之间的有向流程\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f5f4\"/><g fill=\"#254755\" font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"27\" y=\"63\">对齐注汽焖井生产</text><polyline points=\"175,57 189,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"174\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"63\">拟合周期产油代理</text><rect x=\"187\" y=\"32\" width=\"164\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b97e45\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polyline points=\"350,57 364,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"349\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"365\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"63\">约束蒸汽量搜索参数</text><polyline points=\"525,57 539,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"524\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"63\">核对收益与热量账</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"125\">当前步骤：拟合周期产油代理</text></g></svg><figcaption>冻结的周期产油代理。候选预测不调用生成式或测试标签。</figcaption></figure><figure><h3>约束蒸汽量搜索参数</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"输入与结果之间的有向流程\"><rect width=\"720\" height=\"210\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0f5f4\"/><g fill=\"#254755\" font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei\" font-size=\"17\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"27\" y=\"63\">对齐注汽焖井生产</text><polyline points=\"175,57 189,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"174\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"190\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"63\">拟合周期产油代理</text><polyline points=\"350,57 364,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"349\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"365\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\"377\" y=\"63\">约束蒸汽量搜索参数</text><rect x=\"362\" y=\"32\" width=\"164\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b97e45\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polyline points=\"525,57 539,57\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#247d83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"524\" y=\"53\">›</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"35\" width=\"158\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcebe7\"/><text x=\